  "cues": [
    {
      "s": 0.15,
      "e": 3.899,
      "text": "ACR brings compute benchmarks, billing evidence,"
    },
    {
      "s": 3.749,
      "e": 6.802,
      "text": "and on-chain infrastructure into one product."
    },
    {
      "s": 7.451587,
      "e": 10.283586999999999,
      "text": "Let\u2019s check a bill in the chat: forty-seven cents"
    },
    {
      "s": 10.133586999999999,
      "e": 13.441586999999998,
      "text": "for twenty-three thousand inference tokens. Aomi"
    },
    {
      "s": 13.291587,
      "e": 16.692587,
      "text": "calls ACR\u2019s bill checker and rate tool. You"
    },
    {
      "s": 16.542586999999997,
      "e": 19.234586999999998,
      "text": "can inspect the actual calls as they run, then"
    },
    {
      "s": 19.084587,
      "e": 20.512587,
      "text": "read the recommendation."
    },
    {
      "s": 27.451586999999996,
      "e": 29.969586999999997,
      "text": "Open the trace. The bill checker receives the"
    },
    {
      "s": 29.819587,
      "e": 33.220586999999995,
      "text": "total amount and twenty-three units of one thousand"
    },
    {
      "s": 33.070586999999996,
      "e": 36.297587,
      "text": "tokens. Its response includes five public price"
    },
    {
      "s": 36.147587,
      "e": 39.373587,
      "text": "references and the age of the evidence. The separate"
    },
    {
      "s": 39.223586999999995,
      "e": 42.322587,
      "text": "rate call returns the oracle address and index"
    },
    {
      "s": 42.172587,
      "e": 42.972587,
      "text": "freshness."
    },
    {
      "s": 43.623197,
      "e": 46.652197,
      "text": "Aomi recommends review because this example is"
    },
    {
      "s": 46.502196999999995,
      "e": 50.251197,
      "text": "about fifty-one times the returned market benchmark."
    },
    {
      "s": 50.101197,
      "e": 53.467197,
      "text": "It also says the price evidence is nearly thirteen"
    },
    {
      "s": 53.317197,
      "e": 56.579197,
      "text": "days old. Different models and billing terms may"
    },
    {
      "s": 56.429197,
      "e": 59.087197,
      "text": "not be comparable. The index is separate from"
    },
    {
      "s": 58.937197,
      "e": 61.652197,
      "text": "market pricing, and no payment has been made."
    },
    {
      "s": 68.44197833333334,
      "e": 71.11897833333333,
      "text": "This is more than an API integration."
    },
    {
      "s": 71.15897833333334,
      "e": 74.64797833333334,
      "text": "ACR has an on-chain oracle, attestations,"
    },
    {
      "s": 74.68797833333333,
      "e": 76.77997833333333,
      "text": "and settlement infrastructure."
    },
    {
      "s": 76.87097833333333,
      "e": 78.87397833333334,
      "text": "Aomi connects protocol-specific"
    },
    {
      "s": 78.91397833333333,
      "e": 80.97597833333333,
      "text": "knowledge and off-chain records"
    },
    {
      "s": 81.01597833333334,
      "e": 85.13797833333334,
      "text": "to a harness that can prepare reviewed contract actions."
    },
    {
      "s": 85.58897833333333,
      "e": 86.65197833333332,
      "text": "For treasury payments,"
    },
    {
      "s": 86.69197833333334,
      "e": 89.24097833333332,
      "text": "the recorded bill determines the recipient,"
    },
    {
      "s": 89.28097833333334,
      "e": 92.00397833333335,
      "text": "amount, category, and decision hash."
    },
    {
      "s": 92.04397833333334,
      "e": 95.03397833333332,
      "text": "Aomi stages spendAsOwner, simulates it,"
    },
    {
      "s": 95.07397833333334,
      "e": 97.27497833333334,
      "text": "and requests owner authorization."
    },
    {
      "s": 97.31497833333333,
      "e": 100.01497833333332,
      "text": "The guard restricts chain, contract, and function;"
    },
    {
      "s": 100.05497833333334,
      "e": 102.20897833333333,
      "text": "PolicyWallet enforces ownership,"
    },
    {
      "s": 102.24897833333333,
      "e": 105.07197833333333,
      "text": "budget, and replay protection."
    },
    {
      "s": 105.52197833333332,
      "e": 109.31297833333332,
      "text": "After payment, ACR verifies the successful receipt and"
    },
    {
      "s": 109.35297833333334,
      "e": 112.41297833333334,
      "text": "matching event before reconciling the original bill."
    },
    {
      "s": 112.45297833333333,
      "e": 114.99097833333332,
      "text": "That closes the loop: off-chain evidence,"
    },
    {
      "s": 115.03097833333334,
      "e": 116.83697833333332,
      "text": "authorized on-chain action,"
    },
    {
      "s": 116.87697833333334,
      "e": 119.84997833333335,
      "text": "and a business record that knows what settled."
    },
    {
      "s": 120.30097833333335,
      "e": 123.59297833333335,
      "text": "That is the foundation for one-shotting a protocol app."
    },
    {
      "s": 123.63297833333334,
      "e": 125.92697833333332,
      "text": "Describe the workflow, connect the infrastructure,"
    },
    {
      "s": 125.96697833333334,
      "e": 128.73597833333335,
      "text": "and define the contract actions and guards."
    },
    {
      "s": 128.77597833333334,
      "e": 131.47697833333334,
      "text": "Aomi supplies the agent runtime and frontend"
    },
    {
      "s": 131.51697833333336,
      "e": 134.67597833333335,
      "text": "component around those protocol-specific pieces."
    },
    {
      "s": 135.12597833333336,
      "e": 137.31497833333333,
      "text": "The frontend integration is shipped."
    },
    {
      "s": 137.35497833333335,
      "e": 139.75297833333332,
      "text": "The treasury workflow is implemented,"
    },
    {
      "s": 139.79297833333334,
      "e": 142.24897833333335,
      "text": "with production payment acceptance still pending."
    },
    {
      "s": 142.28897833333332,
      "e": 144.61797833333333,
      "text": "The value is one agent that connects"
    },
    {
      "s": 144.65797833333335,
      "e": 147.87497833333333,
      "text": "understanding the protocol with acting on it."
    }
  ]
}